{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823570/extras/1d87b9f805239a33d6a0dfddad7cf5c7.poster.avif?t=1774443592\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823570/extras/1d87b9f805239a33d6a0dfddad7cf5c7.webm?t=1774443592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Welcome to the game where the Queen is King!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning chess has never been this simple \u2014 or this thrilling. <strong>Choc Tactic for Chess Master</strong> honors the timeless art of chess by infusing it with the energy of a battle royale and the deep strategy of an RPG. <br>Your chessboard becomes a living battlefield \u2014 an arena where every tactical position can turn the tide of war in a single move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Imagine the combined power of your playstyle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pawn that doesn\u2019t just advance one square, but charges through enemy lines to gain ground.<br>A rook that builds a defensive shield to protect your flank.<br>Here, every move is a meaningful strategic choice that shapes the entire match.<br>Each game is a unique tactical puzzle \u2014 where your creativity, foresight, and resource management are the keys to a brilliant victory.<br>Adapt your playstyle to every situation, exploiting your team\u2019s strengths while guarding its weaknesses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Sharpen your mind, boost your ELO!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game \u2014 it\u2019s a true training ground for your strategic intelligence.<br>It challenges your focus and strengthens your ability to calculate the future.<br>Each match pushes you to anticipate moves, evaluate outcomes, and dominate the board with surgical precision.<br>Mastering <strong>Choc Tactic for Chess Master</strong> will refine your tactical vision and elevate your real-world ELO, making you a more formidable player both online and over-the-board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Chess, Respected:</strong><br>No randomness \u2014 every move follows the pure logic of chess, crafted with strategic mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u265f\ufe0f Unique Pieces:</strong><br>Collect and command a wide range of units, each with its own distinct abilities and style.<br>Build your dream team, create devastating synergies, and conquer the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Infinite Tactical Depth:</strong><br>Classic chess movement meets limitless strategy.<br>Defend your king with turn-based precision or unleash an all-out offensive for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf10 Challenge the World:</strong><br>Face other players in intense online battle royale mode \u2014 where only one survives.<br>Or test your wits against an adaptive AI that learns from your tactics and grows stronger with every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Epic Visual Style:</strong><br>Witness the chessboard come alive with stunning animations and cinematic effects.<br>Every capture becomes a moment of glory in a beautifully crafted tactical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield awaits.<br>Will you rise as the <strong>Chess Master</strong> who turns ancient strategy into modern victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Add <i>Choc Tactic for Chess Master</i> to your Wishlist today \u2014 and prepare for the ultimate tactical shock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video